      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The camera is a funny one to me. There are multiple issues with the camera including how VR interaction becomes impossible when a vrc_interact volume is inside a vrc_trigger volume. Effectively making interactive buttons, such as the camera buttons, useless whenever you are in almost any trigger volume used in worlds.\nThis particular interaction bug breaks worlds that have this setup in their puzzles or options on grabbable panels, etc.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
