      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d80f78838ff191b9e6f9a5d|full_name}: We are not dismissing any of these reports-- in fact, some of them are already tracked elsewhere or have already been posted. Omnibus reports are not permitted on our feedback boards.\nOmnibus reports are very difficult to take apart, address individual issues, get any kind of details from, or action upon. We specifically request in the guidelines for these boards not to make omnibus reports. They will be closed.\nIf the individual items are posted with repro steps, output logs, details, etc, we'll be more than happy to handle those per our standard method. However, our guidelines exist for a reason-- so we can stay organized and keep knocking out bugs efficiently.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
